    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:a36f0e154b107f4658a21f66b2edd7821b3b234e584d7849b65c6eca68345c99",
    "task": "(In a large field at night, the player has just completed a request for Ayumi - a Skeleton girl.)\n\nAyumi: “[player]! You got my arrows back!”\n\n[player]: “Sure did, Ayumi! How’s everything going now?”\n\nAyumi: “Much better, thank you! With my arrows returned, I feel much safer now.”\n\n[player]: “That’s great to hear!”\n\nAyumi: “It really is! I can’t express how grateful I am for your help. Those arrows are not only my weapons but also a part of me.”\n\n[player]: “I’m glad I could assist you, Ayumi. Is there anything else I can do for you?”",
    "chosen": "Ayumi: \"Oh, you've already done so much for me, [player]. But since you're offering, there is one more thing that's been on my mind.\"\n\n[player]: \"Of course, Ayumi. What is it?\"\n\nAyumi: \"Well, I've been thinking about expanding my skills and learning some new techniques to better protect myself and my friends. I heard there's a skilled archer in the nearby town who might be able to teach me a thing or two.\"\n\n[player]: \"That sounds like a great idea! I can help you find this archer and introduce you. Would you like that?\"\n\nAyumi: \"Yes, I would appreciate that very much! I'm a bit shy when it comes to meeting new people, so having you there would make me feel more comfortable.\"\n\n[player]: \"It's a deal then. Let's head to the town together and find this skilled archer. I'm sure you'll learn a lot from them.\"\n\nAyumi: \"Thank you, [player]! I'm really looking forward to it. Let's go!\"\n\n(The player and Ayumi set off towards the town, excited for the new adventure and the opportunity for Ayumi to grow as an archer.)",
    "rejected": "[player]: “I’m here to help, Ayumi. If you need anything else, just let me know. I’m always ready to lend a hand.”",
